OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome late
OL,6,Fspells of sunshine, but cloud slowly
OL,7,Fincreasing overnight with outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain, mainly to the north, and
OL,9,Fclearing eastwards. Staying mostly
OL,10,Fcloudy thorough until dawn and mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FGradually brightening up,
OL,13,Fafter a cloudy and damp start. Dry
OL,14,Finto the afternoon with sunny spells.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,17,Fspells and showers expected throughout
OL,18,Fthis period. Some of the showers will
OL,19,Fbe heavy and times, with the risk of
OL,20,Fhail and thunder. A fresh feel for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
